t(46, 1645, """Establishing the proof and clearing one's responsibility regarding this one who has gone clearly astray

Abdulaziz al-Qahtani's claim that the children of Imam Ali and Fatima, peace be upon them both, who live in the land of Canaan, sanctify themselves is a claim written against you and recorded in the record of your deeds; so beautiful patience, and Allah is the one whose help is sought against what you describe. You declared an entire Muslim people unbelievers, you were racist for your tribalism and went the ways of those whose tongues have rotted. Then you repeated and reiterated your loathing for the family of the House among those who live in the land of Canaan, and claimed that those of the family of the House who live in the land of Canaan have corrupted the religion and ruined Islam, and you presumed to swear on behalf of the Mighty Lord that He loathed the children of Fatima and Ali, peace be upon them both, who live in the land of Canaan!! How wretched! By Allah, I have never heard of an ignoramus steeped in the first Jahiliyyah and in setting up enmity toward the family of the House of the Messenger of Allah who live in the land of Canaan like you. I see you have gone clearly astray and have openly declared enmity to the family of the House of Prophethood in broad daylight, and then you end the evil speech seeking support from the Shia, calling them "O my brothers"!! So long as their support serves you to gain a kingship your soul has sought!! Changing and altering the religion of Allah, saying that our Lord did not command us to obey Muhammad ibn Abdullah but commanded us to obey the Messenger, scattering the minds of Muslims with your old nonsense, which we warned against before without naming you. Indeed, your misguidance has shown itself through sagging molars, and through a lip torn by the thorns of your assault on the station of your master Muhammad ﷺ and his family by your saying he has no superiority over anyone. He is your master and the crown on your head, and his superiority is over you and over your forefathers.

Then you will pay the price of your assault with foul, filthy words against the Messiah, peace be upon him, and his mother the Truthful, peace be upon her""")

